</tr>
<tr>
<td><a href="img/tyranno_hako001.jpg">
<img height="283" src="img/tyranno_hako001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/modelmaker/GRIFFON/T_rex/img/tyranno_hako001.jpg" --></a></td><td>
